    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441770/extras/cdcba441deacaf9485d1ad86c1d0a827.poster.avif?t=1754530656\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441770/extras/cdcba441deacaf9485d1ad86c1d0a827.webm?t=1754530656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441770/extras/cdcba441deacaf9485d1ad86c1d0a827.mp4?t=1754530656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Moonlight in Garland</strong> is a cozy, open-ended life sim set in the bustling metropolis of Garland. Whether you\u2019re growing houseplants or helping out your new neighbours, every day brings fun, friendships and the weird side of city life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce6<i><strong>\u00a0Unpack your boxes, find your people, and make Garland your home.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, every city has its challenges\u2026</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you handle the thrilling, edge-of-your-seat excitement of attending a monthly resident committee meeting?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you forge life long friendships through mildly questionable but well intentioned crimes?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to better your local community by showing kindness and making small changes: to the extreme!?!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you like trains? Or anthropomorphic recycling bins?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc8c\u00a0<i>City life is calling, and you're going to love it here!</i>*</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*<i>Apartment quality may vary. Loving it not guaranteed\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Authorised by the Garland City Council Tourism Department.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441770/extras/2cfc4ef376e7a0abc28987ca85ba024d.poster.avif?t=1754530656\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441770/extras/2cfc4ef376e7a0abc28987ca85ba024d.webp?t=1754530656\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Moonlight in Garland is a solo dev project made with love and tea. It's still in active development and your feedback helps shape the future of the city. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Check out the roadmap for more info!\u00a0\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441770/extras/ef507d854e80108244f835a5cb873ea1.poster.avif?t=1754530656\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441770/extras/ef507d854e80108244f835a5cb873ea1.webm?t=1754530656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441770/extras/ef507d854e80108244f835a5cb873ea1.mp4?t=1754530656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441770/extras/98649393a0fb643775972c5014514c25.poster.avif?t=1754530656\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441770/extras/98649393a0fb643775972c5014514c25.webm?t=1754530656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83c\udf06 <strong>Move in!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from four apartment buildings to match your vibe. Each building has it\u2019s own unique storyline, apartment layouts, <span class=\"bb_strike\">problems</span> quirks and community events. As your life in Garland grows, let Ryan at Quality Real Estate help you upgrade to a bigger space or a different building\u2026 for a very reasonable fee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udcbc Get to work!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re gonna need a way to fund your new extravagant lifestyle, so consider taking on part-time jobs. Join the gig-economy as a delivery person, track down suspects as an ethically challenged private investigator or dabble in stock trading. If you have some spare time you can always sign up to the Council\u2019s Recycling or Initiatives programs to earn cash for bigger community projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc96 <strong>Build deep connections!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">City life can get lonely so befriend or romance a diverse cast of 22 residents through relationship events and watch their stories unfold. Nothing brings people closer together than accidentally stealing a helicopter together, right? With 18 romancable characters, customisable commitment and break up options (dump someone via sky writing!!) there\u2019s heaps of ways to connect\u2026 or disconnect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f\u00a0<strong>Get involved!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your local community is what you make of it. Clean up trash, scrub graffiti, pick wild herbs and gather pebbles to polish into crystals to keep your neighbourhood beautiful. Someone\u2019s gotta do it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u23f0 <strong>Balance your time and energy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage both physical and mental energy to get the most out of every day. Feeling tired? Try one of Dr Hannah\u2019s specially formulated Buffins for that extra pep in your step! Feeling mentally drained? Take some time out to relax at your window and just watch the world go by.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Decorate your space!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget worrying about your security deposit in Garland! Grow houseplants, change your wallpaper, rearrange furniture and make your apartment feel like home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf89 Live that life!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy seasonal festivals, fish, photograph wildlife, contribute to the museum or just take life one day at a time. Cities grow and change, so as development continues you\u2019ll find more things to love around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc96 See you in Garland!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441770/extras/78babd33960506ac97f9a97ba8848717.poster.avif?t=1754530656\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441770/extras/78babd33960506ac97f9a97ba8848717.webm?t=1754530656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441770/extras/734bfa4020bcf22b813cca1583931a64.avif?t=1754530656\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&lt;3 Violet</p>",
